Cloudflare zone setting change

BASELINE:
  zone setting: always_use_https=off
  HTTP app/staging/api-staging roots: 530 while Tunnel had no active edge connection

MODIFIED:
  zone setting: always_use_https=on
  HTTP app/staging/api-staging roots: 301
  Location preserves host, path, and query string

API operation:
  PATCH /zones/<zone>/settings/always_use_https
  body: {"value":"on"}

No DNS record, Tunnel ingress, WAF, DDoS, billing, or account setting is changed by this operation.
